5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The old three-person split is mathematically obsolete. We need data, not nostalgia.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually does the math. It’s always the same person.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We should verify if the current load matches the current usage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
