13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the upfront costs of changing the metering setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think we should check how the other house handled their recent changes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
