35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The data is stark. One room consumes four times more than the others.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,I tried the template. It’s a nightmare. It takes hours to key in every invoice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I see the variance. February was nearly triple August. The old split ignores this.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The log shows late payments when amounts shifted. I need stability, not surprises.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The cooler notice says people avoided arguing. I don’t want that here.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, if the template is too hard, we need a simpler metric.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,Exactly. I can’t spend my whole weekend doing this. It’s not sustainable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The monitor readings confirm the heater is the culprit. We must account for that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,I am afraid of a system that changes every month. I need a fixed baseline.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I think we should just split it evenly. It’s the kindest way to start.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Even splits are unfair when usage varies by four. We need a tiered approach.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with Benjamin. But who calculates the tiers? I refuse to be the accountant.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I can calculate the tiers. I enjoy the quiet work of balancing the books.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If Jonathan does the math, I can accept a tiered system. I need predictability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I’m a little scared of tiers. What if I get the highest one?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The tiers will be based on room characteristics, not personal habits.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,That sounds fair. I just need to know it won’t eat my life.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will draft the tiers based on the monitor data. It will be objective.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I will review the draft. I need to see the numbers before I agree.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I trust you all to be fair. I just want us to stay friends.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
